OL,3,AMother of woman found hanging in tree
OL,4,Ashocked as police say body was staged
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details
OL,9,FThe mother of a woman found hanging in
OL,10,Fa tree in Mississippi has spoken of her
OL,11,Fshock after authorities said they
OL,12,Fbelieved her daughter was dead before
OL,13,Fher body was placed at the allegedly
OL,14,F"staged" crime scene.
OL,16,FTasia Fortune, a 29-year-old mother of
OL,17,Ffour, was found hanging from a tree at
OL,18,Fan abandoned home in Jackson in August.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
