OL,3,AMother of woman found hanging in tree
OL,4,Ashocked as police say body was staged
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery sparked widespread fears
OL,7,Fin the majority-black city because of
OL,8,Fthe state's deep history of racial
OL,9,Fviolence and lynchings. But on Friday,
OL,10,Fpolice said that Fortune had been dead
OL,11,Fbefore her body was hanged from the
OL,12,Ftree.
